nd 3PL pre-alerts and invoices against PO in compliance with local import-export team; crate freight KPIs and good records out of all transactions; Export order documents creation and support on COO if needed; Ensure best practices are aligned with standard processes in place; Coordination with the order management team for return materials ; Logging of RMA in the RMA tracker maintain RMA Log Report; Create and maintain documentation for logistics distribution processes and systems; Support planning with all logistics providers, including sharing requirements via SIOP process; Ensure proper documentation and record keeping as per compliance; Proactive support to Internal/Statutory/Excise and customs auditor; Have structured weekly calls and regular KPI reports with the freight forwarders ; Manage DC operations to reduce overtime if any; Manage cost reductions in DC and freight; Use of Global metrics and ensure DC is operating within these; 

