The Mental Health Clinician I provides individual and group behavioral health services to adults experiencing mental health and substance use challenges, helping veterans achieve recovery, stability, and improved well-being. As part of a multidisciplinary treatment team, this role delivers compassionate, person-centered care while connecting clients with the resources and support they need to thrive.


